  "body": "Found while pinning #1215 (PR #1290): creating a turning operation in a setup with NO machine mounted is refused with \"... the setup's machine is a mill - mount a lathe (or a mill-turn) first\". The refusal is right, but no machine is mounted, so 'is a mill' misstates it.\n\nDone means: with no machine mounted the message says so (e.g. \"the setup has no machine mounted - mount a lathe (or a mill-turn) first\"); the mill case keeps its wording; pinned.\n",
